  m_Name: Level1(1-7)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "\"You mentioned the workshop earlier\u2014what was it like when your piece de
    resistance was unveiled? Was it a big event...?\""
  - 'Oh, it was magnificent.

'
  - 'The unveiling was held in a grand hall filled with distinguished patrons and
    critics. The lamp was displayed under a soft light, its glass petals glowing
    as if they were alive.

'
  - "Everyone was in awe\u2014I remember the gasps, the applause, the way Claire
    smiled with pride. It was 1902, I believe\u2026 a time when artistry was indeed
    celebrated.\r\n"
